WEBVTT

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:08.530
Fighto! Fighto! Fighto! Fighto!

00:00:08.530 --> 00:00:10.350
Red data animals?

00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:17.000
I thought that you probably would like it, Aoyama-kun…

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:19.380
If it’s okay with you, perhaps…

00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:20.710
Umm…

00:00:20.710 --> 00:00:23.010
Maybe this Sunday we could…

00:00:23.010 --> 00:00:23.810
Sure!

00:00:26.180 --> 00:00:28.430
I’ll be waiting for you
at 10 at the station.

00:00:32.970 --> 00:00:34.440
ALL RIGHT!

00:00:35.140 --> 00:00:38.730
I did it!! This is great!!

00:00:38.730 --> 00:00:41.020
I can’t believe your dream of a date with Aoyama-kun has come true!!

00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:44.700
It’s all because you devote
your whole heart to him, right?

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:04.390
I hit my nose!

00:01:05.510 --> 00:01:07.760
I’ve got no time to worry about that right now!

00:01:07.760 --> 00:01:10.380
Geez, how could I have gone back to sleep after stopping the alarm!?

00:01:11.720 --> 00:01:13.220
Arrhh! The ribbon snapped!

00:01:13.220 --> 00:01:17.190
I stayed up too late planning this date!!
I need to change these…

00:01:20.520 --> 00:01:22.570
I hit my nose again!

00:01:25.480 --> 00:01:27.740
Mom, Dad, I’m leaving now!

00:01:27.740 --> 00:01:28.150
Ichigo!!

00:01:28.860 --> 00:01:30.730
I’m on my way!

00:01:32.370 --> 00:01:34.460
I’m Momomiya Ichigo, 7th grade.

00:01:34.910 --> 00:01:37.960
I was so nervous last night that I couldn’t get any sleep,

00:01:37.960 --> 00:01:40.920
…but I dozed off for a bit in the morning. {dosed -> dozed}

00:01:41.460 --> 00:01:45.300
I can barely run now.
I’m too excited about today.

00:01:45.800 --> 00:01:48.300
Because… this is the first time…

00:01:48.300 --> 00:01:51.670
I can be with a smart,
good-looking, athletic boy…

00:01:54.850 --> 00:01:57.470
…who is the ultimate dream for any girl.

00:01:58.020 --> 00:02:00.260
With… with… with…

00:02:21.250 --> 00:02:22.490
Good morning.

00:02:23.460 --> 00:02:25.330
I have his smile all to myself…

00:02:26.300 --> 00:02:27.510
Anything wrong?

00:02:27.510 --> 00:02:29.880
Um, nothing at all…

00:02:29.880 --> 00:02:31.680
Sorry I’m late.

00:02:33.010 --> 00:02:35.340
Isn’t today’s weather just the greatest?

00:02:36.060 --> 00:02:38.340
Yup, I guess. Shall we go?

00:02:44.940 --> 00:02:45.610
Umm…

00:02:47.360 --> 00:02:48.120
Well…

00:02:50.900 --> 00:02:53.280
We have really nice weather today!

00:02:53.280 --> 00:02:54.110
You’re right.

00:02:54.740 --> 00:02:58.240
Oh dear… I repeated myself…

00:02:58.240 --> 00:03:00.960
I just don’t know what to say…

00:03:00.960 --> 00:03:02.080
Momomiya-san.

00:03:02.080 --> 00:03:02.620
YES!

00:03:03.920 --> 00:03:04.720
We’re here.

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:16.500
<i>Announcement: We hope you will enjoy your visit here.</i>

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:20.270
<i>Please take your time looking around.</i>

00:03:20.270 --> 00:03:21.970
This really is nice.

00:03:21.970 --> 00:03:23.230
Huh?

00:03:23.230 --> 00:03:27.900
…that you have invited me to this show,

00:03:27.900 --> 00:03:30.900
since I’ve been wanting
to see it for a while.

00:03:30.900 --> 00:03:34.200
Oh, that’s because I researched everything about you…

00:03:34.820 --> 00:03:36.700
Umm… Oh nothing…

00:03:36.700 --> 00:03:37.940
Hey, what could that be?

00:03:38.530 --> 00:03:41.900
It seems to be a symbol for this place.
Doesn’t it look interesting?

00:03:42.540 --> 00:03:44.370
<i>Please, continue…</i>

00:03:56.430 --> 00:04:01.130
The red data animals are endangered species.

00:04:01.520 --> 00:04:05.730
According to the brochure, more than 2500 species face extinction.

00:04:05.730 --> 00:04:08.140
Really…

00:04:08.860 --> 00:04:11.480
There’s an unusual picture of an Iriomote Wildcat over here.

00:04:11.480 --> 00:04:12.740
Aah, coming!

00:04:12.740 --> 00:04:14.350
Isn’t it cute?

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:18.570
Ahh~ This cat is also listed in the Red Data…

00:04:19.200 --> 00:04:23.550
These animals become extinct, even with our protection…

00:04:25.570 --> 00:04:26.670
Ahh, nothing!

00:04:26.670 --> 00:04:30.040
That means… We must protect the Earth ourselves from now on!

00:04:30.040 --> 00:04:30.540
Somehow…

00:04:31.450 --> 00:04:32.830
I guess so…

00:04:34.130 --> 00:04:35.880
This is definitely the best…

00:04:36.550 --> 00:04:40.230
Nothing matters as long as I’m on this date with Aoyama-kun forever.

00:04:48.900 --> 00:04:49.700
What’s wrong?

00:04:50.270 --> 00:04:51.490
Please look at this.

00:04:52.610 --> 00:04:54.190
It’s perfect.

00:04:59.240 --> 00:05:01.070
Thanks for the pictures!

00:05:09.380 --> 00:05:11.130
Thanks for coming with me today.

00:05:11.130 --> 00:05:12.750
I’m glad I did.

00:05:12.750 --> 00:05:14.260
It really is a nice day today.

00:05:15.800 --> 00:05:18.220
Oh, you said the same thing
a while ago.

00:05:20.340 --> 00:05:21.500
That’s true.

00:05:23.220 --> 00:05:25.610
I’ve been thinking about it for a while…

00:05:27.770 --> 00:05:29.300
It’s something very important to you…

00:05:30.400 --> 00:05:31.450
Aoyama-kun.

00:05:31.900 --> 00:05:33.910
Could it be? So suddenly…

00:05:35.060 --> 00:05:35.990
But…!

00:05:37.320 --> 00:05:41.290
I want keep talking with you…
about protecting nature.

00:05:42.030 --> 00:05:42.920
What’s wrong?

00:05:43.780 --> 00:05:45.530
Err… nothing. I’ll go get us some juice.

00:05:50.530 --> 00:05:51.760
Are you all right?

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:53.970
Thank you.

00:05:57.040 --> 00:05:58.170
Umm…

00:05:58.880 --> 00:06:00.270
I’ll go buy them.

00:06:00.720 --> 00:06:04.130
Just sit here and wait for me, Momomiya-san.

00:06:04.640 --> 00:06:05.640
But…

00:06:05.640 --> 00:06:07.980
Why not lie on the lawn?
It’ll be comfortable.

00:06:10.140 --> 00:06:12.070
He carried me…

00:06:15.940 --> 00:06:18.600
Arghh, it’s so so soooo embarrassing.

00:06:20.570 --> 00:06:22.290
This is really nice.

00:06:29.370 --> 00:06:32.010
How cute!!! Is it a shop?

00:06:32.750 --> 00:06:35.240
Maybe Aoyama-kun and I
could check it out later.

00:06:35.800 --> 00:06:37.710
The preparations are complete…

00:06:38.090 --> 00:06:39.100
Okay.

00:06:42.010 --> 00:06:45.210
The Earth’s future… is about to change.

00:06:53.810 --> 00:06:55.060
It’s time.

00:06:56.070 --> 00:06:57.710
Mew project… {maybe do these 2 lines with \alpha timing?}commence!

00:06:57.710 --> 00:06:58.770
Mew project… commence!

00:07:09.250 --> 00:07:10.110
An earthquake?

00:07:13.420 --> 00:07:15.300
Aoyama-kun, Aoyama-kun?

00:07:19.260 --> 00:07:19.930
W-What?

00:07:32.940 --> 00:07:33.780
Where…?

00:07:34.480 --> 00:07:36.070
Where am I?

00:07:39.060 --> 00:07:41.860
That’s the cat Aoyama-kun and I saw just now.

00:07:41.860 --> 00:07:44.450
An Iriomote Wildcat??

00:07:45.410 --> 00:07:46.410
Come here…

00:07:58.590 --> 00:08:01.370
The cat went inside me…

00:08:04.630 --> 00:08:05.600
Eh?

00:08:06.090 --> 00:08:08.600
For some reason… It feels nice!

00:08:21.730 --> 00:08:23.330
How nice…

00:08:29.580 --> 00:08:32.330
I didn’t fall asleep, did I?!?

00:08:32.330 --> 00:08:33.700
You seemed very comfy.

00:08:33.700 --> 00:08:35.210
I’m so sorry!

00:08:35.210 --> 00:08:36.710
Here, have some juice.

00:08:36.710 --> 00:08:38.630
I got worried after the earthquake.

00:08:38.630 --> 00:08:40.010
Thank you.

00:08:40.460 --> 00:08:41.260
Here.

00:08:42.340 --> 00:08:45.040
Umm, have you been
waiting for me all this time?

00:08:45.800 --> 00:08:48.560
Not that long.
Only about three hours.

00:08:49.390 --> 00:08:51.350
THREE HOURS?!

00:08:51.350 --> 00:08:53.600
He’s right! It’s evening already!

00:08:53.600 --> 00:08:54.930
I’ll walk you home.{Let’s go home.}

00:08:54.930 --> 00:08:55.940
Okay.

00:09:02.230 --> 00:09:03.690
Eh, what do you mean?

00:09:04.070 --> 00:09:06.710
So… the date was ruined?

00:09:07.410 --> 00:09:09.940
I’m also VERY embarrassed about it…

00:09:10.830 --> 00:09:13.200
I can’t even face him now…

00:09:13.200 --> 00:09:16.210
Who the heck falls asleep on a first date?{It’s unusual for someone to fall asleep on a first date? // opposite meaning}

00:09:16.210 --> 00:09:17.660
He probably hates you now.

00:09:18.420 --> 00:09:19.750
No, he doesn’t!

00:09:19.750 --> 00:09:22.550
Aoyama-kun’s very kind,
so he’s sure to forgive me!

00:09:22.550 --> 00:09:25.420
What kind of a girl falls asleep in front of her boyfriend?

00:09:25.420 --> 00:09:27.670
If I were you, I would die of embarrassment!{be embarrassed to death}!

00:09:27.670 --> 00:09:30.050
What would you do
if you had snored?

00:09:30.050 --> 00:09:32.060
I didn’t snore!

00:09:32.810 --> 00:09:33.630
Perhaps…

00:09:34.520 --> 00:09:37.470
But what if I did… What should I do?

00:09:37.470 --> 00:09:41.050
Oh yeah! Why don’t I just…
talk to him one more time?

00:09:42.150 --> 00:09:44.060
But… I don’t know what to say!

00:09:45.070 --> 00:09:46.940
If we meet up, something good will come of it.

00:09:47.190 --> 00:09:51.240
That’s it! Now I’ve got a good excuse to talk to him again!

00:09:51.240 --> 00:09:52.360
How lucky!

00:09:53.400 --> 00:09:55.290
Ah! I forgot…

00:09:55.290 --> 00:09:57.910
Aoyama-kun is in the gym for
early-morning exercise. I have to hurry!

00:09:57.910 --> 00:09:58.790
Hold on, Ichigo!

00:09:58.790 --> 00:10:00.070
Wait up!

00:10:02.950 --> 00:10:04.520
We are too late…

00:10:04.520 --> 00:10:05.830
…as expected.

00:10:05.830 --> 00:10:06.750
So what now?

00:10:06.750 --> 00:10:10.230
We can’t even see anything from here,
much less do anything.

00:10:11.380 --> 00:10:11.880
The face!

00:10:11.880 --> 00:10:14.100
Point! Match over.

00:10:16.060 --> 00:10:19.840
That’s the spirit. If you keep it up,
we might reach the national tournament.

00:10:22.360 --> 00:10:23.350
Nope, I’m still not ready.

00:10:24.570 --> 00:10:26.310
Aoyama-kun~

00:10:26.820 --> 00:10:29.530
Wow, great… They can actually reach the nationals.

00:10:29.530 --> 00:10:34.500
I can’t believe this girl messed up her chance to date someone this popular.

00:10:35.080 --> 00:10:39.780
He’s too busy now, so you’ll just have to wait till lunch break to talk to him.

00:10:40.840 --> 00:10:41.780
It’s okay!

00:10:41.780 --> 00:10:46.000
I have to keep this secret from everyone{alternate suggestion: It’s a secret to everybody}, but I went on a date with him yesterday…

00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:47.220
What’s that?

00:10:48.760 --> 00:10:49.790
This is…

00:10:51.630 --> 00:10:52.960
Oh no! There goes my…

00:10:56.260 --> 00:10:57.220
Got it! {^o^ / Emoticons like this = not really needed}

00:10:57.220 --> 00:10:58.520
Ichigo, watch out!

00:11:00.940 --> 00:11:01.590
Ichigo!

00:11:10.820 --> 00:11:12.450
Um, what just happened?

00:11:16.450 --> 00:11:18.240
Are you all right, Ichigo?

00:11:21.320 --> 00:11:22.280
Ichigo!

00:11:23.250 --> 00:11:25.780
<i>All rise!</i>

00:11:29.170 --> 00:11:30.420
Ichigo.

00:11:30.420 --> 00:11:31.680
Ichigo…

00:11:35.470 --> 00:11:37.750
You know, it’ll rain soon.

00:11:38.180 --> 00:11:40.310
Even though it’s such a nice day?

00:11:40.310 --> 00:11:43.190
Stop lazing around!
It’s already lunch break.

00:11:43.190 --> 00:11:45.680
Weren’t you going to apologize to Aoyama-kun?

00:11:46.060 --> 00:11:49.140
Oh yeah, I have to hurry.

00:11:50.280 --> 00:11:53.350
Oh yeah! You were so great this morning, Ichigo.

00:11:53.820 --> 00:11:55.660
Yep yep, that was just amazing.

00:11:56.240 --> 00:11:57.570
I was surprised myself! Nya~

00:11:58.080 --> 00:12:00.330
At that time, I really thought I would die but…

00:12:00.330 --> 00:12:02.750
I actually managed to land on my feet.{original: landed well. // new line plays up the "cat" aspect}

00:12:10.710 --> 00:12:11.370
Ichigo?

00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:13.180
What are you doing?

00:12:17.090 --> 00:12:18.810
Oh no, what’s wrong with my mouth?

00:12:21.130 --> 00:12:21.840
Ichigo?!

00:12:22.800 --> 00:12:24.930
I’ve been acting so weird today!

00:12:26.100 --> 00:12:27.110
Why?

00:12:27.770 --> 00:12:32.280
I’ve been sleepy since this morning,
I suddenly got really agile…

00:12:32.280 --> 00:12:35.270
And then I went and picked up a fish in my mouth! It’s almost as if…

00:12:42.330 --> 00:12:43.870
That dream…?

00:12:43.870 --> 00:12:45.000
Momomiya-san.

00:12:46.330 --> 00:12:47.800
So there you are.

00:12:48.880 --> 00:12:50.210
Aoyama-kun!

00:12:50.210 --> 00:12:54.010
I saw the commotion this morning at the match, and I was worried.

00:12:54.760 --> 00:12:55.720
Are you okay?

00:12:57.840 --> 00:13:00.940
Umm, don’t worry about that.
Thanks for yesterday nya~

00:13:01.920 --> 00:13:04.270
Did I just say… nya?

00:13:05.640 --> 00:13:06.810
What’s wrong?

00:13:06.810 --> 00:13:08.070
There’s nothing wrong nya!

00:13:09.060 --> 00:13:13.560
I was just thinking about…
 how you waited for me for so long.

00:13:13.560 --> 00:13:14.990
That’s okay.

00:13:16.150 --> 00:13:17.480
Isn’t the weather also nice today?

00:13:18.070 --> 00:13:20.740
Yup nya! But it’s going to rain later nya!

00:13:22.450 --> 00:13:25.540
By the way… nya nya…
but I don’t really know… nya nya.

00:13:25.540 --> 00:13:27.490
I shouldn’t have fallen
asleep-nya yesterday.

00:13:27.830 --> 00:13:29.830
Nya… nyaaaaa~

00:13:29.830 --> 00:13:31.120
Nyaaaaaaaaaa~!

00:13:31.120 --> 00:13:32.200
Momomiya-san?

00:13:35.420 --> 00:13:36.880
What? Rain?

00:13:36.880 --> 00:13:38.720
But the weather was fine a while ago.

00:13:38.720 --> 00:13:40.480
Let’s go. I don’t want to get wet.

00:13:43.890 --> 00:13:46.170
Something strange really <i>is</i> happening to me…

00:13:47.230 --> 00:13:51.360
Yesterday, Aoyama-kun and I waited here and there was an earthquake.

00:13:51.360 --> 00:13:52.450
And then…

00:13:54.190 --> 00:13:55.280
Eh?

00:13:55.280 --> 00:13:57.410
Why don’t I remember
what happened next?

00:13:59.610 --> 00:14:03.330
Aoyama-kun… What happened to me…?

00:14:05.830 --> 00:14:08.490
What? I just felt really weird…

00:14:08.490 --> 00:14:09.550
Where?

00:14:12.540 --> 00:14:13.790
Over there!

00:14:22.600 --> 00:14:24.550
What is it? What is it?

00:14:31.270 --> 00:14:32.550
Aoyama-kun?

00:14:33.810 --> 00:14:36.390
Did he{changed he-> you since this is a thought} come here just for me?

00:14:39.240 --> 00:14:40.160
Ah, hold on.

00:14:41.320 --> 00:14:42.460
Geez…

00:14:55.000 --> 00:14:55.700
Momomiya-san?

00:15:00.630 --> 00:15:01.930
Eh?

00:15:34.130 --> 00:15:36.380
NOOooooooo…!

00:15:36.380 --> 00:15:38.760
Aoyama-kun, Aoyama-kun!

00:15:46.260 --> 00:15:47.270
Are you all right?

00:15:48.310 --> 00:15:49.810
Momomiya Ichigo.

00:15:52.480 --> 00:15:54.150
How did you know my name?

00:15:54.150 --> 00:15:57.060
Let’s leave the introductions for later.
First, defeat that.

00:15:57.060 --> 00:15:58.530
Huh? Me?

00:16:01.990 --> 00:16:03.700
You’re heavier than you look.

00:16:03.700 --> 00:16:06.450
Let me go! Who <i>are</i> you, anyway?

00:16:06.450 --> 00:16:08.570
Now’s not the time for that.

00:16:09.410 --> 00:16:10.780
Aoyama-kun!

00:16:22.220 --> 00:16:23.210
I did it again?

00:16:26.300 --> 00:16:27.630
Momomiya Ichigo.

00:16:28.550 --> 00:16:31.350
You’re special. Take this.

00:16:31.350 --> 00:16:32.050
Mew Strawberry!

00:16:35.560 --> 00:16:38.010
Mew… Strawberry?

00:16:40.530 --> 00:16:42.330
So, that wasn’t a dream.

00:16:46.860 --> 00:16:48.570
Words…

00:16:48.570 --> 00:16:53.070
…coming from somewhere in my body…
no, my heart!

00:16:53.960 --> 00:16:55.750
Mew Mew Strawberry!

00:16:55.750 --> 00:16:58.510
METAMORPHO-SE! {metamorphose, not metamorphosis}

00:17:34.900 --> 00:17:36.860
That’s it. Now it begins!

00:17:37.670 --> 00:17:39.320
What’s with these clothes?

00:17:39.920 --> 00:17:41.510
Hold on…

00:17:43.750 --> 00:17:44.910
What now?

00:17:45.300 --> 00:17:47.390
Some words magically came out.

00:17:48.930 --> 00:17:50.350
StrawberBell!

00:18:06.570 --> 00:18:10.520
That’s it, I don’t care anymore!
I’ll just have to fight you!

00:18:12.730 --> 00:18:14.320
Stop right there, you monster!

00:18:15.410 --> 00:18:17.820
How dare you try to harm Aoyama-kun?

00:18:21.790 --> 00:18:24.910
I’ll give you a heaping serving of "gratitude" ~nya! {I’ll give you a taste of cat spirit! Nyaaw!} {I’m not 100% sure on this line, but h-b’s was almost totally made up. The JP line has the same "gohoushi suru" phrase that appears in the "I’ll serve the Earth’s future" catchphrase."}

00:18:45.270 --> 00:18:49.310
Reborn Strawberry… CHECK!!

00:19:04.340 --> 00:19:05.260
Retrieved. {I can’t remember if this changes to "Collected" in later episodes.}

00:19:13.180 --> 00:19:15.760
Aoyama-kun! Aoyama-kun!

00:19:15.760 --> 00:19:18.720
Well done! Wow, you really pulled it off!

00:19:19.060 --> 00:19:20.690
What the heck is going on?

00:19:21.690 --> 00:19:24.990
I don’t understand this at all,
so explain yourself!

00:19:28.440 --> 00:19:31.660
Don’t cry. You’re the chosen one.

00:19:32.660 --> 00:19:33.610
Don’t worry.

00:19:34.570 --> 00:19:37.070
We are not your enemies.

00:19:38.200 --> 00:19:41.050
We’ll explain everything to you soon enough.

00:19:41.910 --> 00:19:46.210
As for him, he’ll be all right.
He… just fainted.

00:19:46.210 --> 00:19:49.010
I’ll accept the responsibility of sending him home.

00:19:49.590 --> 00:19:50.500
But…

00:19:51.840 --> 00:19:56.050
Pleased to meet you.
I’m Akasaka Keiichirou.

00:19:56.050 --> 00:19:59.710
Ryou, that attitude will cause our princess to hate you.{Ryou, this charming lady will not be pleased with your behavior. // he does use "himegimi" (princess)}

00:20:01.100 --> 00:20:06.060
It’ll be a great honor to escort a special lady like yourself.

00:20:06.060 --> 00:20:08.060
“Special lady”??

00:20:08.480 --> 00:20:09.770
Let’s go.

00:20:10.780 --> 00:20:12.140
Go? Go where?

00:20:12.820 --> 00:20:16.910
Ehh? What’s going on?
I don’t understand anything at all.

00:20:16.910 --> 00:20:21.590
And just who exactly are that arrogant guy
and that really polite gentleman!?

00:20:25.140 --> 00:20:28.600
Man, I just don’t understand what’s going on anymore!

00:20:28.600 --> 00:20:32.580
But it’s all their fault that my date with Aoyama-kun went awry, and that my body…

00:20:32.580 --> 00:20:34.250
…changed into something weird!

00:20:34.570 --> 00:20:35.880
How are you going to compensate me?!

00:20:35.880 --> 00:20:37.360
Isn’t that pretty?

00:20:37.360 --> 00:20:38.380
Oh really?

00:20:37.970 --> 00:20:38.380
I lied.

00:20:38.990 --> 00:20:41.410
Hurry up and find your fellow members.

00:20:41.410 --> 00:20:43.660
W-What? You LIED?!

00:20:43.660 --> 00:20:44.850
Wait, “members”?

00:20:45.450 --> 00:20:49.270
Next: “A New Comrade,
Justice Dwells in a Real Lady{or: a Super-Rich Girl} ~nya!”

00:20:49.960 --> 00:20:52.270
For the Earth’s future,
we’ll be of service ~nya! {or a more compact way to render this: "We’ll serve the Earth’s future ~nya!}
